    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a cyberpunk metropolis as the mercenary, Zoey Madison. Find a way to navigate the seductive and corrupt Neon City. Choose who to trust, what to desire, and how far you'll go. Are you in it for the pleasure? Or will you stay pure?\u200e  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/4f1b744d9cae1b8effe0f00366ed02fc.avif?t=1755345395\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/5dd1cb162ccaf7087c13d0ea7e40c482.poster.avif?t=1755345395\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/5dd1cb162ccaf7087c13d0ea7e40c482.webm?t=1755345395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/5dd1cb162ccaf7087c13d0ea7e40c482.mp4?t=1755345395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delight yourself with fully-animated adult scenes that reward your boldest choices. Expressive, erotic, and tailored to your journey. What is your Zoey willing to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e\u200e \u200e \u200e  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/772e6f79fd1f26e08d49c0a61377788d.avif?t=1755345395\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400350/extras/de7cee30b8f0d9ce78ef088d376e7db2.poster.avif?t=1755345395\" width=